WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.710
DharmaAI | Local book knowledge assistant

00:00:04.710 --> 00:00:07.513
1. Select an original sample PDF

00:00:07.513 --> 00:00:15.026
2. Extract text and index with local embeddings | wait shortened

00:00:15.026 --> 00:00:16.526
3. Book indexed locally | three searchable chunks

00:00:16.526 --> 00:00:19.144
4. Ask a question about the book

00:00:19.144 --> 00:00:26.381
5. Retrieve context and call Ollama | inference wait shortened

00:00:26.381 --> 00:00:31.118
6. A real generated answer grounded in the uploaded PDF

00:00:31.118 --> 00:00:35.460
7. Expand the retrieved source passages

00:00:35.460 --> 00:00:39.000
8. Spoken playback | verified by the project owner

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:41.500
9. Try a question outside the book

00:00:41.500 --> 00:00:46.263
10. Unrelated question rejected without a generation call

00:00:46.263 --> 00:00:53.289
Voice input and playback confirmed by the owner | controls shown

00:00:53.289 --> 00:01:00.100
Recorded demo available independently of the optional local app
